             yet - an open hole, recorded in §9.",
    ),
    (
      id: "owlcat_familiar",
      category: "Decorative",
      confidence: Inferred,
      sigil: "owlcat",
      signs: [("puppet", Around)],
      effect: "A spell sculpted into the rough shape of an owlcat.",
      note: "Owlcat Head is this sigil minus the body, which is the wiki's own
